<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MDU Resources restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MDU Resources restarted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Tuesday analyst Donato Eassey had restarted coverage of MDU Resources Group Inc with ratings of near-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Bismarck, N.D., natural resources company opened up 1/4 to 22-1/2/.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
